-- 福利抽奖开奖人数门槛：不足人数时报名与开奖自动顺延，超过最多顺延次数仍不足则作废。可重复执行。
SET @lm_sql = IF(EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = 'welfare_campaigns' AND column_name = 'minParticipants'), 'SELECT 1', 'ALTER TABLE `welfare_campaigns` ADD COLUMN `minParticipants` INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 AFTER `entryCount`'); PREPARE lm_stmt FROM @lm_sql; EXECUTE lm_stmt; DEALLOCATE PREPARE lm_stmt;
SET @lm_sql = IF(EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = 'welfare_campaigns' AND column_name = 'extendHours'), 'SELECT 1', 'ALTER TABLE `welfare_campaigns` ADD COLUMN `extendHours` INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 24 AFTER `minParticipants`'); PREPARE lm_stmt FROM @lm_sql; EXECUTE lm_stmt; DEALLOCATE PREPARE lm_stmt;
SET @lm_sql = IF(EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = 'welfare_campaigns' AND column_name = 'maxExtensions'), 'SELECT 1', 'ALTER TABLE `welfare_campaigns` ADD COLUMN `maxExtensions` INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 AFTER `extendHours`'); PREPARE lm_stmt FROM @lm_sql; EXECUTE lm_stmt; DEALLOCATE PREPARE lm_stmt;
SET @lm_sql = IF(EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = 'welfare_campaigns' AND column_name = 'extensionCount'), 'SELECT 1', 'ALTER TABLE `welfare_campaigns` ADD COLUMN `extensionCount` INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 AFTER `maxExtensions`'); PREPARE lm_stmt FROM @lm_sql; EXECUTE lm_stmt; DEALLOCATE PREPARE lm_stmt;
